### ==========================================
### NVIDIA API → OpenAI Proxy - Contoh Request
### ==========================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### Gunakan VS Code REST Client extension
### ==========================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### List Models
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer anything

### Chat Completion (Non-Streaming)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer anything

{
  "model": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hello! Explain what API Proxy does in one sentence."
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "max_tokens": 2048,
  "stream": false
}

### Chat Completion (Streaming)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer anything

{
  "model": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Count from 1 to 5."
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "max_tokens": 512,
  "stream": true
}

### Embeddings
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/embeddings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer anything

{
  "model": "nvidia/nv-embedqa-e5-v5",
  "input": "Hello world, this is a test embedding request."
}

### Responses API (Non-Streaming)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer anything

{
  "model": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct",
  "input": "Explain what API Proxy does in one sentence.",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "max_output_tokens": 2048
}

### Responses API (Streaming)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer anything

{
  "model": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct",
  "input": "Count from 1 to 5.",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "max_output_tokens": 512,
  "stream": true
}

